  "title": "msgpack: assert on invalid type bytes",
  "description": "Add `DISSECTOR_ASSERT_NOT_REACHED()` to functions handling the\nvarious messagepack types, to reflect that they will only be called with\nspecific values of the `type` byte. This should have no functional or\nperformance effect, but it will save a developer having to scroll down\nto `dissect_msgpack_object()` to see how the type function is called.\n\nCloses #20530",
